      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "- Test user thread can create new thread.\n- Verify that given thread and thread stack permissions to the user thread, allow to create new user thread.\n- Verify that new created user thread have access to its own thread object by aborting itself.",
