        "spdx:FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/test"
      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "System makes kernel object kobject_public_sem public to all threads Test the access to that kernel object by creating two new user threads.\n\n*See also:* k_object_access_all_grant()",
      "externalIdentifier": [
        {
          "type": "ExternalIdentifier",
