      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "A lock attempt with a finite timeout must succeed when the holding thread releases the mutex before the timeout elapses.\n\n*See also:* k_mutex_lock()\n\n*See also:* k_mutex_unlock()",
