      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "This thread will lock on mutex_1, mutex_2, mutex_3 and mutex_4. It later recursively locks private_mutex, releases it, then re-locks it.\n\n*See also:* sys_mutex_lock()\n\n*See also:* sys_mutex_unlock()",
      "externalIdentifier": [
