      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "- manipulating thread state to consider case where no polling thread is available during event signalling.\n- defined a signal poll as waitable events in poll and verify the result after signal raised\n\n*See also:* K_POLL_EVENT_INITIALIZER(), k_poll(), k_poll_signal_init(), k_poll_signal_check(), k_poll_signal_raise()",
