    },
    {
      "type": "functionalsafety_RequirementVerification",
      "spdxId": "zephyr:verifications/poll-api-1cpu--test-poll-wait",
      "functionalsafety_verificationMethod": [
        "spdx:FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/test"
      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "Test Objective:\n\n- Test the poll operation which enables waiting concurrently for one/two/all conditions to be fulfilled.\n- set a single timeout argument indicating the maximum amount of time a thread shall wait.\n\nTesting techniques:\n\n- function and block box testing.\n- Interface testing.\n- Dynamic analysis and testing.\n\nPrerequisite Conditions:\n\n- CONFIG_TEST_USERSPACE\n- CONFIG_DYNAMIC_OBJECTS\n- CONFIG_POLL\n\nInput Specifications:\n\n- N/A\n\nTest Procedure:\n\n- Use FIFO/semaphore/signal/message queue object to define poll event.\n- Initialize the FIFO/semaphore/signal/message queue object.\n- Create a thread to put FIFO, give semaphore, raise signal, and put message queue.\n- Check the result when signal is raised, semaphore is given, fifo is filled, and message is received.\n- Check the result when no event is satisfied.\n- Check the result when only semaphore is given.\n- Check the result when only FIFO is filled.\n- Check the result when only signal is raised.\n- Check the result when only message is received.\n\nExpected Test Result:\n\n- FIFO/semaphore/signal/message queue events available/waitable in poll.\n\nPass/Fail Criteria:\n\n- Successful if check points in test procedure are all passed, otherwise failure.\n\nAssumptions and Constraints:\n\n- N/A\n\n*See also:* k_poll_signal_init(), k_poll()",
      "externalIdentifier": [
        {
          "type": "ExternalIdentifier",
          "comment": "ztest case",
          "externalIdentifierType": "other",
          "identifier": "poll_api_1cpu__test_poll_wait"
        }
      ],
      "name": "poll_api_1cpu__test_poll_wait",
      "summary": "Test polling with wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "functionalsafety_RequirementVerification",
      "spdxId": "zephyr:verifications/poll-api-1cpu--test-poll-zero-events",
