    {
      "type": "functionalsafety_RequirementVerification",
      "spdxId": "zephyr:verifications/threads-scheduling--test-pending-thread-wakeup",
      "functionalsafety_verificationMethod": [
        "spdx:FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/test"
      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "The test creates a cooperative thread and let it wait for semaphore. Then calls k_wakeup(). The k_wakeup() call should return gracefully without waking up the thread\n\n*See also:* k_wakeup()",
