      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "Create a preemptive thread, lock the scheduler and call k_is_preempt_thread(). Unlock the scheduler and call k_is_preempt_thread() again. Create a cooperative thread and lock the scheduler k_is_preempt_thread() and unlock the scheduler and call k_is_preempt_thread().\n\n*See also:* k_is_preempt_thread()",
