          "identifier": "threads_scheduling__test_slice_scheduling"
        }
      ],
      "name": "threads_scheduling__test_slice_scheduling",
      "summary": "Check the behavior of preemptive threads when the time slice is disabled and enabled."
    },
    {
      "type": "functionalsafety_RequirementVerification",
      "spdxId": "zephyr:verifications/threads-scheduling--test-time-slicing-disable-preemptible",
      "functionalsafety_verificationMethod": [
        "spdx:FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/test"
      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "Create 3 threads with -1, 0, and 1 as priority, setup time slice for threads with priority 0. Make sure the threads with equal priorities are executed in time slice. Also run k_busy_wait() for 5 secs and check if other threads are not executed at that time.\n\n*See also:* k_busy_wait()",
      "externalIdentifier": [
        {
          "type": "ExternalIdentifier",
          "comment": "ztest case",
          "externalIdentifierType": "other",
          "identifier": "threads_scheduling__test_time_slicing_disable_preemptible"
        }
      ],
      "name": "threads_scheduling__test_time_slicing_disable_preemptible",
      "summary": "Check the behavior of preemptive thread with k_busy_wait()."
    },
    {
      "type": "functionalsafety_RequirementVerification",
      "spdxId": "zephyr:verifications/threads-scheduling--test-time-slicing-preemptible",
      "functionalsafety_verificationMethod": [
        "spdx:FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/test"
      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "Create 3 threads with -1, 0, and 1 as priority, setup time slice for threads with priority 0. Make sure the threads with equal priorities are executed in time slice.",
      "externalIdentifier": [
        {
          "type": "ExternalIdentifier",
          "comment": "ztest case",
          "externalIdentifierType": "other",
          "identifier": "threads_scheduling__test_time_slicing_preemptible"
        }
      ],
      "name": "threads_scheduling__test_time_slicing_preemptible",
      "summary": "Validate preemptive thread behavior with time slice."
    },
    {
      "type": "functionalsafety_RequirementVerification",
      "spdxId": "zephyr:verifications/threads-scheduling--test-unlock-nested-sched-lock",
      "functionalsafety_verificationMethod": [
        "spdx:FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/test"
      ],
      "creationInfo": "zephyr:creationinfo",
      "description": "In a preemptive thread, lock the scheduler twice and create a cooperative thread. Call k_sched_unlock() and check the cooperative thread haven't executed. Unlock it again to see the thread have executed this time.\n\n*See also:* k_sched_lock(), k_sched_unlock()",
